    "Rings like the Clock app at each dose time, also in silent mode and Focus. Follow-ups stay notifications." : {
      "comment" : "Add and edit screen: the footer under the Alarm switch. A follow-up is the repeated reminder of Remind Again, and it stays a normal notification.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klingelt zu jeder Einnahmezeit wie die Uhr-App, auch im Stumm-Modus und bei einem Fokus. Erneute Erinnerungen bleiben Mitteilungen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suena a cada hora de toma como la app Reloj, también en modo silencio y con un modo de concentración. Los recordatorios repetidos siguen siendo notificaciones."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服用時刻ごとに「時計」アプリのように鳴り、消音モードや集中モードでも鳴ります。再通知は通常の通知のままです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "복용 시간마다 시계 앱처럼 울리고, 무음 모드와 집중 모드에서도 울려요. 다시 알림은 일반 알림으로 와요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次服用时间会像“时钟”App 一样响铃，静音模式和专注模式下也会响。再次提醒仍是普通通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop" : {
