          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今はしない"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "나중에"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暂不"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share how you use the app, such as whether you recorded a dose today. Maru never shares item names, doses, or times. You can change this in Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Usage statistics notice in the EU, the UK, and Switzerland: the message. The statistics are off until the user agrees.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Teile, wie du die App nutzt, zum Beispiel ob du heute eine Dosis erfasst hast. Maru teilt nie Namen, Dosen oder Zeiten. Du kannst das in den Einstellungen ändern."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparte cómo usas la app, por ejemplo si has registrado una dosis hoy. Maru nunca comparte nombres de elementos, dosis ni horas. Puedes cambiarlo en Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日服用を記録したかどうかなど、機能の利用状況を共有します。項目名、用量、時刻は共有しません。「設定」でいつでも変更できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오늘 복용을 기록했는지 같은 앱 사용 정보를 공유해요. 항목 이름, 용량, 시간은 절대 공유하지 않아요. 설정에서 언제든 바꿀 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "共享功能使用情况，例如今天是否记录了服用。Maru 绝不共享项目名称、剂量或时间。你可以随时在“设置”中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Maru to record this dose." : {
      "comment" : "Widget: the prompt after a tap on a capsule that could not record. The system then opens the app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffne Maru, um diese Dosis zu erfassen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abre Maru para registrar esta dosis."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maruを開いてこの服用を記録してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru를 열어 이 복용을 기록하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
