    "Maru reminds you up to %lld times for each dose, until %@ at the latest." : {
      "comment" : "Add and edit screen: the footer of “Until Recorded”. iPhone has no reminder that repeats with no end, so Maru states the limit. The first placeholder is the number 12. The second is the time of the next day at which the reminders of a dose stop, for example “1:00 AM”.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru erinnert dich bis zu %lld Mal pro Dosis, spätestens bis %@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru te recuerda hasta %lld veces por dosis. Límite: %@."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maruは1回の服用につき最大%lld回、遅くとも%@までリマインドします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru는 복용 1회당 최대 %lld번, 늦어도 %@까지 미리 알려줘요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次服用，Maru 最多提醒 %lld 次，最晚到 %@ 为止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maru reads only the name." : {
      "comment" : "Label scan: the line under the prompt before the user taps a text. The scan reads no amount and no time.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru liest nur den Namen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru solo lee el nombre."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maruが読み取るのは名前だけです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru는 이름만 읽어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru 只读取名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maru sets the reminders of the next 7 dose days each time you open it." : {
      "comment" : "Item detail: the footer of a plan that counts days (every other day, every few days, or days on and days off) when its reminders are set. iPhone has no repeating reminder for this plan, so Maru sets dated reminders at each open.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru plant die Erinnerungen für die nächsten 7 Einnahmetage bei jedem Öffnen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru programa los recordatorios de los próximos 7 días de toma cada vez que lo abres."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maruを開くたびに、今後7回分の服用日のリマインダーを設定します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru를 열 때마다 다음 7번의 복용일에 맞춰 미리 알림을 설정해요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次打开时，Maru 会设置接下来 7 个服用日的提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maru stops its reminders and hides it from Today and My Items. Your records stay. This is not advice to stop taking it." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the archive confirmation. The word it means the item that the title names. Archive hides an item, and the records stay.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru beendet seine Erinnerungen und blendet ihn in Heute und Meine Einträge aus. Deine Aufzeichnungen bleiben. Das ist keine Empfehlung, die Einnahme zu beenden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru detiene sus recordatorios y lo oculta de Hoy y de Mis elementos. Tus registros se conservan. Esto no es una recomendación de dejar de tomarlo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maruはこの項目のリマインドを止め、「今日」と「マイ項目」から非表示にします。記録は残ります。これは服用をやめるための助言ではありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru가 이 항목의 미리 알림을 멈추고 오늘과 내 항목에서 숨겨요. 기록은 그대로 남아요. 복용을 멈추라는 조언이 아니에요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru 会停止它的提醒，并在“今天”和“我的项目”中隐藏它。你的记录会保留。这不是停止服用的建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maru tries again when you open it." : {
      "comment" : "Item detail: the footer of the plan when the reminder is not set yet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru versucht es erneut, wenn du die App öffnest."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maru lo intenta de nuevo cuando lo abres."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maruを開くと、もう一度試します。"
