    "Since %@. Days with all taken: %lld. Most: %lld. Some: %lld. None: %lld." : {
      "comment" : "History: the VoiceOver value of the graph with no selected day. The first placeholder is the first day of the graph, for example August 10. The numbers count the days by the share of the planned doses that are taken.",
